    "title": {
      "en": "New WoW: Forever Beta Build with Level 30 Cap Coming Tomorrow",
      "es": "Nueva versión de WoW: Forever Beta con límite de nivel 30 que llegará mañana"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "New WoW: Forever Beta Build with Level 30 Cap Coming Tomorrow...",
      "es": "Nueva versión de WoW: Forever Beta con tapa de nivel 30 que llegará mañana..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6abe752634a682.70401284\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has announced that the World of Warcraft: Forever Beta will undergo maintenance tomorrow morning, but when it comes back online \"several hours later,\" it will include an updated build with changes and fixes, and the level cap will be raised from 20 to 30!<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2367661/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Tomorrow morning PDT, we will take the WoW Forever Beta offline for maintenance. Several hours later, the Beta will resume with an updated build that includes changes and fixes, with the level cap raised to 30.<br><br><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-forever-beta-development-notes-%E2%80%93-updated-september-24/2360696/1\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">We’ll have all the details here tomorrow</a>.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has announced that the World of Warcraft: Forever Beta will undergo maintenance tomorrow morning, but when it comes back online &quot;several hours later,&quot; it will include an updated build with changes and fixes, and the level cap will be raised from 20 to 30! <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Tomorrow morning PDT, we will take the WoW Forever Beta offline for maintenance. Several hours later, the Beta will resume with an updated build that includes changes and fixes, with the level cap raised to 30.<br /><br /><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-forever-beta-development-notes-%E2%80%93-updated-september-24/2360696/1\" rel=\"nofollow\">We’ll have all the details here tomorrow</a>.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
