    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6abe76591807b9.42799621\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has released a video going over some of the major class changes for Warriors, Shamans and Rogues in WoW: Forever.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Cb8r05IXiyI/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><br><br><span class=\"large-text\">Prot Warrior</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Rage from damage is now generated based on weapon speed.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Rage generation is based on pre-mit damage.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Thunder Clap is now usable in Defensive Stance.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Vanguard lets you charge from Defensive Stance.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Shield Wall, Retaliation and Recklessness no longer share a cooldown.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Arms Warrior</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Weaponmaster combines all the old weapon specialization talents.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Spearing Strike is a new ability that dismounts players.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Fury Warrior</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">New Raging Blows talent: Whirlwind now strikes with the off-hand and reduces the rage cost of Cleave.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Restoration Shamans</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Have 3 new spells that lets you summon a customizable set of totems with a single cast.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">A new totem bar lets you assign totems with each cast.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Totemic Projection lets you relocate your active totems.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Riptide is coming to Restoration Shamans, which increases the effectiveness of Chain Heal.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Elemental Shaman</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">They also get the totem bar and Totemic Projection.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Totems last for 5 minutes.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fire Nova is a new spell, rather than a totem.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Lava Burst is coming as well, with bonus damage if the target has Flame Shock on it.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Lightning Overload gives lightning spells a chance to cast again at no cost.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Subtlety Rogue</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Rogue Energy now recovers continuously.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Stealth and Bleed effects will play a larger role in the damage rotation.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Cutthroat will allow you to cast Ambush outside of stealth.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Assassination Rogue</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Mutilate now strikes with both weapons, giving double the chance to crit.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Venom is a new finisher that increases poison damage.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Combat Rogue</span><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Hack and Slash is a new talent that encompasses different weapon types.</div></li></ul></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has released a video going over some of the major class changes for Warriors, Shamans and Rogues in WoW: Forever.<br /><br />Prot Warrior<br /><br /><ul><li>Rage from damage is now generated based on weapon speed.</li><li>Rage generation is based on pre-mit damage.</li><li>Thunder Clap is now usable in Defensive Stance.</li><li>Vanguard lets you charge from Defensive Stance.</li><li>Shield Wall, Retaliation and Recklessness no longer share a cooldown.</li></ul><br /><br />Arms Warrior<br /><br /><ul><li>Weaponmaster combines all the old weapon specialization talents.</li><li>Spearing Strike is a new ability that dismounts players.</li></ul><br /><br />Fury Warrior<br /><br /><ul><li>New Raging Blows talent: Whirlwind now strikes with the off-hand and reduces the rage cost of Cleave.</li></ul><br /><br />Restoration Shamans<br /><br /><ul><li>Have 3 new spells that lets you summon a customizable set of totems with a single cast.</li><li>A new totem bar lets you assign totems with each cast.</li><li>Totemic Projection lets you relocate your active totems.</li><li>Riptide is coming to Restoration Shamans, which increases the effectiveness of Chain Heal.</li></ul><br /><br />Elemental Shaman<br /><br /><ul><li>They also get the totem bar and Totemic Projection.</li><li>Totems last for 5 minutes.</li><li>Fire Nova is a new spell, rather than a totem.</li><li>Lava Burst is coming as well, with bonus damage if the target has Flame Shock on it.</li><li>Lightning Overload gives lightning spells a chance to cast again at no cost.</li></ul><br /><br />Subtlety Rogue<br /><br /><ul><li>Rogue Energy now recovers continuously.</li><li>Stealth and Bleed effects will play a larger role in the damage rotation.</li><li>Cutthroat will allow you to cast Ambush outside of stealth.</li></ul><br /><br />Assassination Rogue<br /><br /><ul><li>Mutilate now strikes with both weapons, giving double the chance to crit.</li><li>Venom is a new finisher that increases poison damage.</li></ul><br /><br />Combat Rogue<br /><br /><ul><li>Hack and Slash is a new talent that encompasses different weapon types.</li></ul></noscript>            \n        ",
